# Enterprise Unified Sales Executive Workspace Plan

Transform LeadGrowth into a unified, high-performance Enterprise Sales Executive Workspace. This plan merges Lead and Task management into a single workspace, introduces step-by-step sales workflows, client timeline tracking, connected daily report submission and manager approvals, real-time WebSocket notifications, auto-save engines, scoped campaign performance, and history logging across all modules.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Module Unification**: The `/leads` and `/tasks` views for Sales Executives will be synthesized into a unified `/my-work` (My Work / Lead Workspace) route, while maintaining dedicated access for Admins/Managers.
> - **Role Scoping**: Financial metrics (Budget, ROAS, ROI, Company Revenue, Spend) will be hidden for `ROLE_USER` sales executives in the Campaign module, presenting only personal metrics (CTR, Clicks, My Conversions, Revenue Generated By Me).
> - **Database Schema Extensions**: New entity tables (`sales_activities`, `lead_history`, `report_history`) will be registered in MySQL/JPA.

