## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests & Builds
- Run Maven backend build: `mvn clean test-compile` in `backend/` directory.
- Run Vite frontend build: `npm run build` in `frontend/` directory.

### Manual Verification
- Log in as Sales Executive (`user@leadgrowth.com` / `user123` or created user).
- Open `/my-work` workspace: Verify Kanban & Table view toggle, stage drag/drop or move, progress % update, and card metadata.
- Open Work Details Side Panel: Test Activity checklist completion, auto-saving notes, client contact actions, and timeline display.
- Test Follow-ups tab switching, sorting (A-Z, date), and search filtering.
- Submit Daily Report: Verify backend saves report, manager receives notification, and manager approve/reject flow functions end-to-end.
- Test real-time STOMP WebSocket notifications.
